{"sha": "02e58d22cfc179c609fc066145dc546638b80f00aa14cb00b652904aab691095", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:multint:12}", "取由 $(x_i, y_i)$ 到 $(x_{i+1}, y_{i+1})$ 的边，", "参数化为 $\\gamma(t) = \\bigl((1-t)x_i + tx_{i+1},\\ (1-t)y_i +", "ty_{i+1}\\bigr)$。该边对", "$\\frac12\\oint(x\\,\\dd y - y\\,\\dd x)$ 的贡献为", "\\[", "\\frac12\\int_0^1\\Bigl(\\bigl((1-t)x_i +", "tx_{i+1}\\bigr)(y_{i+1} - y_i) - \\bigl((1-t)y_i +", "ty_{i+1}\\bigr)(x_{i+1} - x_i)\\Bigr)\\dd t ,", "\\]", "由于 $\\int_0^1\\bigl((1-t)u + tv\\bigr)\\dd t = \\frac{u +", "v}2$，此式等于", "\\[", "\\frac14\\Bigl((x_i + x_{i+1})(y_{i+1} - y_i) - (y_i +", "y_{i+1})(x_{i+1} - x_i)\\Bigr)", "= \\frac12\\bigl(x_iy_{i+1} - x_{i+1}y_i\\bigr),", "\\]", "交叉项相消。对 $m$ 条边求和，", "即得鞋带公式（见\\cref{cor:b2:multint:area}）。", "三角形 $(0,0), (1,0), (0,1)$：$\\frac12\\bigl((0\\cdot0 - 1\\cdot0) +", "(1\\cdot1 - 0\\cdot0) + (0\\cdot0 - 0\\cdot1)\\bigr) = \\frac12$，", "即正确的面积。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:multint:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 球 $B_n(R)$ 由逐次界描述", "$-R \\leq x_n \\leq R$，然后 $\\abs{x_{n-1}} \\leq \\sqrt{R^2 -", "x_n^2}$，依此类推；将 $x_i = Ru_i$ 代入", "$n$ 个一元积分中，每个都乘以 $R$，并把", "积分限映为 $B_n(1)$ 的积分限：$v_n(R) = R^n\\,v_n(1) =", "V_nR^n$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 沿 $x_n = t$ 截取：$B_n(1)$ 的截面为", "球 $B_{n-1}\\bigl(\\sqrt{1 - t^2}\\bigr)$，故由", "第 1 问，", "\\[", "V_n = \\int_{-1}^1 v_{n-1}\\bigl(\\sqrt{1 - t^2}\\bigr)\\,\\dd t", "= V_{n-1}\\int_{-1}^{1}(1 - t^2)^{\\frac{n-1}2}\\,\\dd t .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{3.} 令 $t = \\sin\\theta$，$\\dd t =", "\\cos\\theta\\,\\dd\\theta$，且 $(1 - t^2)^{\\frac{n-1}2} =", "\\cos^{n-1}\\theta$，均在 $\\intcc{-\\pi/2}{\\pi/2}$ 上：", "\\[", "\\int_{-1}^1(1 - t^2)^{\\frac{n-1}2}\\dd t", "= \\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\cos^n\\theta\\,\\dd\\theta", "= 2\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cos^n\\theta\\,\\dd\\theta = 2W_n,", "\\]", "由 $\\theta \\mapsto \\frac\\pi2 - \\theta$ 可", "互换 $W_n$ 的正弦形式与余弦形式。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 写 $\\sin^n = \\sin^{n-2}(1 - \\cos^2)$，并", "对 $\\int\\sin^{n-2}\\cos\\cdot\\cos$ 分部积分（取 $v =", "\\frac{\\sin^{n-1}}{n-1}$）：", "\\[", "W_n = W_{n-2} - \\frac{W_n}{n-1}", "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad", "W_n = \\frac{n-1}{n}W_{n-2}.", "\\]", "因此 $nW_nW_{n-1} = (n-1)W_{n-1}W_{n-2}$：数列", "$(nW_nW_{n-1})$ 为常数，等于 $1\\cdot W_1W_0 =", "1\\cdot\\frac\\pi2$，故 $W_nW_{n-1} = \\frac{\\pi}{2n}$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 由第 2--3 问得 $V_n = 2W_nV_{n-1}$，连用两次：", "\\[", "V_n = 2W_n\\cdot 2W_{n-1}\\,V_{n-2}", "= 4\\,\\frac{\\pi}{2n}\\,V_{n-2} = \\frac{2\\pi}n\\,V_{n-2}.", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{6.} 由 $V_0 = 1$，得 $V_{2k} = \\frac{2\\pi}{2k}V_{2k-2}", "= \\frac\\pi kV_{2k-2}$，故 $V_{2k} = \\frac{\\pi^k}{k!}$，由", "归纳法可得。由 $V_1 = 2$：$V_{2k+1} =", "\\frac{2\\pi}{2k+1}V_{2k-1}$，故", "\\[", "V_{2k+1} = 2\\prod_{j=1}^k\\frac{2\\pi}{2j+1}", "= \\frac{2^{k+1}\\pi^k}{1\\cdot3\\cdot5\\cdots(2k+1)} .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{7.} $V_1 = 2$，$V_2 = \\pi \\approx 3.142$，$V_3 =", "\\frac{4\\pi}3 \\approx 4.189$，$V_4 = \\frac{\\pi^2}2 \\approx", "4.935$，$V_5 = \\frac{8\\pi^2}{15} \\approx 5.264$，$V_6 =", "\\frac{\\pi^3}6 \\approx 5.168$，$V_7 = \\frac{16\\pi^3}{105}", "\\approx 4.725$。相邻项之比为 $V_n/V_{n-1} = 2W_n$，", "且 $(W_n)$ 单调递减（$\\sin^n \\leq \\sin^{n-1}$", "逐点成立）。现 $2W_5 = 2\\cdot\\frac45\\cdot\\frac23 =", "\\frac{16}{15} > 1$，而 $2W_6 =", "2\\cdot\\frac56\\cdot\\frac34\\cdot\\frac12\\cdot\\frac\\pi2 =", "\\frac{5\\pi}{16} < 1$：比值大于 $1$ 直至 $n = 5$，而", "比值小于 $1$ 始于 $n = 6$ --- $(V_n)$ 先增，", "至其最大值 $V_5$，随后递减。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 当 $n \\geq 13 > 4\\pi$ 时：$V_n/V_{n-2} = 2\\pi/n <", "\\tfrac12$，故 $V_{n} \\leq C\\cdot 2^{-n/2}$，其中", "常数固定；更好地，对任意 $q > 0$，$2\\pi/n < q^2$ 当", "$n$ 充分大时，故 $V_n/q^n \\to 0$：此衰减快于任何", "等比数列。级数 $\\sum V_n$ 的收敛性由比值", "$V_n/V_{n-2} \\to 0$ 推出（自", "某项起与等比级数比较）。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $\\sum_{k\\geq0}V_{2k}x^{2k} =", "\\sum_{k\\geq0}\\frac{(\\pi x^2)^k}{k!} = \\eu^{\\pi x^2}$，即", "指数级数（见\\cref{ch:b2:powerseries}），对", "每个 $x$ 收敛。取 $x = 1$：$\\sum_kV_{2k} = \\eu^\\pi \\approx", "23.14$。", "", "\\textbf{10.} 在立方体 $\\intcc{-R}R^n$ 上，被积函数为", "乘积 $\\prod_i\\eu^{-x_i^2}$，故累次积分", "可分解为 $\\bigl(\\int_{-R}^R\\eu^{-t^2}\\dd t\\bigr)^n$。", "令 $R \\to \\infty$，并利用", "$\\int_\\R\\eu^{-t^2}\\dd t = \\sqrt\\pi$", "（见\\cref{ex:b2:multint:polar}）：$I_n = \\pi^{n/2}$。", ""]}